MP="py -3.13 <your-picture-maker>/make-picture.py"
STY="Classic American comic-book panel illustration, full bleed with no panel border: bold black ink outlines of the same weight, Ben-Day halftone dot shading, flat vivid colours in a warm palette of warm yellows, peanut-butter browns and sky-blue accents, dynamic angle, comic motion lines. No text, no lettering, no speech bubbles, no sound-effect words, no people, no faces."
NEG="text, letters, words, lettering, speech bubble, caption box, sound effect words, onomatopoeia, signature, watermark, logo, label text, face, head, eyes, person, blurry, low quality, photo, photorealistic, 3d render, extra fingers, missing fingers, distorted hands, deformed knife, panel border, frame, multiple panels, splash, liquid, drips, holes in bread"
O=assets_work/comic
$MP "$STY Scene: seen from directly above, two slices of soft white sandwich bread with smooth fine white crumb and thin golden-brown crusts, the classic slice shape with a domed top, lying side by side on a wooden cutting board on a kitchen counter, sky-blue tiles at the edges of the frame, radiating action lines." $O/cm1b --size 1328x1328 --n 4 --seed 1111 --negative "$NEG"
$MP "$STY Scene: dramatic low-angle close-up of one human hand pushing a round-tipped butter knife down into an open plain glass jar full of thick, stiff, creamy tan-brown peanut butter paste, the knife sinking into the paste, bursting action lines around the jar, only the hand and wrist visible." $O/cm2b --size 1328x1328 --n 4 --seed 1211 --negative "$NEG"
$MP "$STY Scene: steep high angle looking down at a square peanut butter sandwich on a wooden cutting board, a big chef's knife slicing down through it along the diagonal line from one corner to the opposite corner, the knife handle held by one hand at the edge of the frame, strong speed lines." $O/cm5b --size 1664x928 --n 4 --seed 1511 --negative "$NEG"
